      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " to me, “Go and buy a linen waistcloth, and put it on your loins, and do not dip it in water.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So I bought a waistcloth according to the word of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", and put it on my loins. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the word of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " came to me a second time, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Take the waistcloth which you have bought, which is upon your loins, and arise, go to the Euphrates, and hide it there in a cleft of the rock.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So I went, and hid it by the Euphrates, as the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " commanded me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And after many days the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to me, “Arise, go to the Euphrates, and take from there the waistcloth which I commanded you to hide there.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then I went to the Euphrates, and dug, and I took the waistcloth from the place where I had hidden it. And behold, the waistcloth was spoiled; it was good for nothing.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the word of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " came to me: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Thus says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ": Even so will I spoil the pride of Judah and the great pride of Jerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This evil people, who refuse to hear my words, who stubbornly follow their own heart and have gone after other gods to serve them and worship them, shall be like this waistcloth, which is good for nothing. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For as the waistcloth clings to the loins of a man, so I made the whole house of Israel and the whole house of Judah cling to me, says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", that they might be for me a people, a name, a praise, and a glory, but they would not listen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“You shall speak to them this word: ‘Thus says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of Israel, “Every jar shall be filled with wine.” ’ And they will say to you, ‘Do we not indeed know that every jar will be filled with wine?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then you shall say to them, ‘Thus says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ": Behold, I will fill with drunkenness all the inhabitants of this land: the kings who sit on David's throne, the priests, the prophets, and all the inhabitants of Jerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will dash them one against another, fathers and sons together, says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". I will not pity or spare or have compassion, that I should not destroy them.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
